essage arrives.\n   Revert the change afterwards.\n5. Check `~/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err` for runs after 2026-10-18. The snapshot\n   stops there, so later runs are not in these files.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CL6hgAD9G86TCfLkghHRXP","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
